# Report / audit markdown: one-off analysis artifacts, never committed.
# Rule: any *report*.md or *audit*.md is ignored (both letter cases). This covers
# e.g. ROOT_CAUSE_REPORT.md, SUMMARY_REPORT.md and GEMINI_VISION_AUDIT.md while
# leaving README.md tracked. All documentation and reports now live under docs/,
# which is fully excluded below.
*AUDIT*.md
*audit*.md
*REPORT*.md
*report*.md

# Documentation (never published to GitHub).
